error[E4101]: cannot borrow `x` as mutable more than once at a time
  --> tests/borrows/fail/E4101_mutable_twice.tarn:30:10
   |
29 |     a := &mut x
   |          ------ mutable borrow of `x` starts here
30 |     b := &mut x
   |          ^^^^^^ second mutable borrow here
31 |     write(a)
   |           - the borrow is still used here
   |
   = note: a borrow lasts until the last use of the reference that holds it

